@startuml forms-vol07-flow
title Sample flow - HIV testing and follow-up (volume 7)
autonumber

actor Client as C
participant "Anonymous /\nclinic office" as OFF
participant "HIV lab\n(vol 7)" as LAB
participant "Dispensary\n(vol 7)" as DISP

C -> OFF : presents for testing
OFF -> OFF : 176-178 testing registration (anonymous\nor identified), 179 negative-status certificate
OFF -> LAB : sample
LAB -> LAB : 186 PCR DNA, 187 CD4 immunology,\n188-193 sample registers
alt positive
  LAB -> DISP : referral to dispensary care
  DISP -> DISP : 175 dispensary control card\n181 ARV / anti-infection drug dispensing
end

note over OFF, DISP
  Confidentiality is central: testing can be anonymous, and
  access is restricted by patient consent. The labs follow the
  same analysis-report pattern as volume 3; the dispensary card
  is a longitudinal record.
end note
@enduml
